{"id": "formulas/items-and-forge", "type": "formulas", "slug": "items-and-forge", "title": "Items and forge: stats, value and costs", "summary": "How the grade, the rank and the forge level change the stats and the value of an item, and what each forge action costs.", "rarity": null, "is_overview": false, "image": null, "infobox": [], "sections": [{"id": "item-power", "heading": "Item power", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "The stats shown on an item page are its base values (rank E, Common, +0). The real value is the base times the item power:", "html": "<p>The stats shown on an item page are its <strong>base values</strong> (rank E, Common, +0). The real value is the base times the item power:</p>"}, {"type": "p", "text": "p o w e r = r a r i t y × ( 1 + 0.6 ( r a n k − 1 ) ) × ( 1 + 0.08 f o r g e ) \\mathrm{power} = \\mathrm{rarity} \\times \\left(1 + 0.6\\,(\\mathrm{rank}-1)\\right) \\times \\left(1 + 0.08\\,\\mathrm{forge}\\right) power = rarity × ( 1 + 0.6 ( rank − 1 ) ) × ( 1 + 0.08 forge )", "html": "<p><span><span><math><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.08</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation>\\mathrm{power} = \\mathrm{rarity} \\times \\left(1 + 0.6\\,(\\mathrm{rank}-1)\\right) \\times \\left(1 + 0.08\\,\\mathrm{forge}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span><span><span></span><span><span>power</span></span><span></span><span>=</span><span></span></span><span><span></span><span><span>rarity</span></span><span></span><span>×</span><span></span></span><span><span></span><span><span>(</span><span>1</span><span></span><span>+</span><span></span><span>0.6</span><span></span><span>(</span><span><span>rank</span></span><span></span><span>−</span><span></span><span>1</span><span>)</span><span>)</span></span><span></span><span>×</span><span></span></span><span><span></span><span><span>(</span><span>1</span><span></span><span>+</span><span></span><span>0.08</span><span></span><span><span>forge</span></span><span>)</span></span></span></span></span></p>"}, {"type": "p", "text": "rank is the tier of the item (E = 1, D = 2, C = 3, B = 4, A = 5, S = 6, S+ = 7, Nation = 8) and forge its forge level.", "html": "<p><code>rank</code> is the tier of the item (E = 1, D = 2, C = 3, B = 4, A = 5, S = 6, S+ = 7, Nation = 8) and <code>forge</code> its forge level.</p>"}, {"type": "table", "headers": ["Grade", "Stat multiplier", "Value multiplier"], "rows": [[{"text": "F Trash"}, {"text": "0.75"}, {"text": "0.5"}], [{"text": "E Common"}, {"text": "1"}, {"text": "1"}], [{"text": "D Uncommon"}, {"text": "1.15"}, {"text": "1.6"}], [{"text": "C Rare"}, {"text": "1.35"}, {"text": "2.6"}], [{"text": "B Epic"}, {"text": "1.6"}, {"text": "4.5"}], [{"text": "A Legendary"}, {"text": "2"}, {"text": "8"}], [{"text": "S Mythic"}, {"text": "2.6"}, {"text": "14"}], [{"text": "EX Limited"}, {"text": "2.4"}, {"text": "12"}]], "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>Grade</th><th>Stat multiplier</th><th>Value multiplier</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>F Trash</td><td>0.75</td><td>0.5</td></tr><tr><td>E Common</td><td>1</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>D Uncommon</td><td>1.15</td><td>1.6</td></tr><tr><td>C Rare</td><td>1.35</td><td>2.6</td></tr><tr><td>B Epic</td><td>1.6</td><td>4.5</td></tr><tr><td>A Legendary</td><td>2</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>S Mythic</td><td>2.6</td><td>14</td></tr><tr><td>EX Limited</td><td>2.4</td><td>12</td></tr></tbody></table>"}, {"type": "ul", "text": "Attack, HP and stat bonuses: base × power (rounded). Damage reduction: base × rarity × (1 + 0.15 × (rank − 1)) × (1 + 0.03 × forge). Critical chance: base × rarity × (1 + 0.03 × forge). Bonus stats (affixes): 1 to 3 times the rank each.", "html": "<ul> <li>Attack, HP and stat bonuses: base × power (rounded).</li> <li>Damage reduction: base × rarity × (1 + 0.15 × (rank − 1)) × (1 + 0.03 × forge).</li> <li>Critical chance: base × rarity × (1 + 0.03 × forge).</li> <li>Bonus stats (affixes): 1 to 3 times the rank each.</li> </ul>"}]}, {"id": "item-value", "heading": "Item value", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "v a l u e = ⌊ b a s e × r a r i t y v a l u e × r a n k × ( 1 + 0.3 f o r g e ) ⌋ \\mathrm{value} = \\left\\lfloor \\mathrm{base} \\times \\mathrm{rarity\\ value} \\times \\mathrm{rank} \\times (1 + 0.3\\,\\mathrm{forge}) \\right\\rfloor value = ⌊ base × rarity value × rank × ( 1 + 0.3 forge ) ⌋", "html": "<p><span><span><math><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>⌊</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>×</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>×</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>×</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo><mo>⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation>\\mathrm{value} = \\left\\lfloor \\mathrm{base} \\times \\mathrm{rarity\\ value} \\times \\mathrm{rank} \\times (1 + 0.3\\,\\mathrm{forge}) \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span><span><span></span><span><span>value</span></span><span></span><span>=</span><span></span></span><span><span></span><span><span>⌊</span><span><span>base</span></span><span></span><span>×</span><span></span><span><span>rarity</span><span> </span><span>value</span></span><span></span><span>×</span><span></span><span><span>rank</span></span><span></span><span>×</span><span></span><span>(</span><span>1</span><span></span><span>+</span><span></span><s